    "type": "cexolocstring",
    "value": {
      "0": "This plate has weathered many a skirmish along the damp shores of Esgaroth. Its iron scales offer a reliable shield against the biting spray of the lake, allowing the one who carries it to move with a nimble grace despite its bulk."
